<p><strong>Salon enquiry management means answering every phone call, Instagram message and WhatsApp question quickly and turning it into a booked appointment. The simplest way is to give every enquirer one online booking link, so they book a stylist and a time without waiting for a reply.</strong></p>
<h2>Where salon enquiries get lost</h2>
<p>A parlour hears from clients in four places at once: the phone, Instagram, WhatsApp and the front desk. Each message asks the same thing: are you free, how much is it, can I come at five? When the stylist is busy with a client, the message waits, and the person books somewhere else.</p>
<ul><li><strong>Slow replies</strong> while staff are with clients.</li><li><strong>Enquiries spread across apps</strong>, so nobody knows who was already answered.</li><li><strong>Free slots that nobody offers</strong> because the diary is on paper.</li><li><strong>No follow-up</strong> with people who asked and never booked.</li></ul>
<h2>A simple way to manage enquiries</h2>
<ol><li><strong>Pick one place to answer.</strong> Choose who watches the phone, Instagram and WhatsApp, and when.</li><li><strong>Reply with a link, not a back-and-forth.</strong> Send the same online booking link every time, so the client chooses a service, a stylist and a free slot.</li><li><strong>Keep availability in one calendar.</strong> The link shows only slots that are really free, so a booking never clashes.</li><li><strong>Follow up on the ones who did not book.</strong> A short message the next day brings some of them back.</li></ol>
<h2>How Zennly fits</h2>
<p>With <a href="/features/booking/">online booking</a>, an enquiry becomes a booking without a reply: the client picks the service, the stylist and a time, and the slot is held. Each booking checks the staff member and time, so there are no double-bookings. When a day is full, a <a href="/blog/waiting-list-management-spa-salon-nepal/">waiting list</a> keeps the people who could not get a slot. <a href="/features/outreach/">Outreach</a> can email clients who have stopped visiting, and SMS and WhatsApp are available on request.</p>
<h2>What Zennly does not do</h2>
<p>Zennly is booking and operations software. It is not an enquiry inbox or a sales CRM, and it does not collect your Instagram or WhatsApp messages into one place. It removes the need for most enquiries by letting the client book directly.</p>
<h2>A quick fix you can start today</h2>
<ol><li>Put one booking link in your Instagram bio and WhatsApp business profile.</li><li>Reply to every enquiry with that link.</li><li>Write down, daily, who asked and did not book, and message them once.</li></ol>
